# Real documents -- never commit a client MTC, a welder package, a crop of one,
# or a photograph. The sample packages carry welder photographs, full names, ID
# numbers and signatures from an operating nuclear site. The ASME Section IX PDF
# is copyrighted: read it to build rule tables, never commit it.
# Once a photograph is in git history, removing it means rewriting history.
fixtures/
sample_docs/
eval_set/
docs/
*.pdf

# The only PDFs that may ever be committed are generated in-process by the test
# suite. Nothing under fixtures/ or docs/ can be re-included: git does not
# descend into an excluded directory, so a negation there would be inert anyway.
!backend/tests/fixtures/generated/*.pdf
